{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t美國總統特朗普與英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳通話。特朗普引述對方指，根本不知道婚外情對象是「間諜」。特朗普又說下星期與國家主席習近平在深圳碰面時，他不會提起這件事。<br/>\n<br/>\n美國國會眾議院的民主黨議員表明，會推動調查黃仁勳的婚外情有否損害美國國家安全。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.700821+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:38:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T20:20:30.501049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.611350+00:00","content_hash":"ddeef0a36459d953667c6a17a5ce4d0cd2b5732890cbfd8c99486908dfed0b06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}